WEBVTT

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:37.330
Until now, the way I fought was that I had
to carry the souls of the guys I beat.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.440
That's why I had to win no matter what.
I always fought my battles like that.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.870
But then I went and blew it.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:49.700
But it's... Not like
our team has lost yet...

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:52.750
Well then, I'm off, Rick.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.920
Hate to ask this, but...

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.710
Take my soul with you.

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:00.150
Okay, Rick!

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:13.280
The final stage of the world
championships is almost over!

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:17.690
After losing the first battle, the PPB All Starz
have their backs against the wall!

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.120
Max Mizuhara takes the
stage for the second battle!

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:29.180
I got it, Rick. I'll take on Takao with your soul--With everyone's!

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:35.090
His opponent from the BBA Revolution
will be none other than Takao Kinomiya!

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:42.550
If they win here, the path to the finals will open for the BBA Revolution, along with F-Sangre!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:48.810
The fated showdown for Takao's third
world championship win will now begin!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:53.150
I already won my battle, so you sure as hell better not lose yours, Takao!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:56.560
I hear ya.
Leave the rest to me!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.730
And well...
Thanks, Daichi.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.490
Takao...

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.590
Advancing to the finals...
A third world championship win...

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:10.380
None of that matters
to me right now.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:15.750
For Daichi, who carried the
team when I was down...

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:20.170
And for some of the best
rivals I could ever ask for...

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.770
I'm just going to hit
you with all I've got!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:30.480
I'm happy, Takao. Fighting you the way
you look now makes me happier than ever.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.450
But this isn't just a battle
between the two of us!

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:39.250
But in order to respond to Rick's, Micheal's,
and everyone else's souls, I will win!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:43.860
And of course, this is the special
stadium you'll all been waiting for!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.330
--This is...!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.350
I'm a Beyblader first,
and a champion second!

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.590
Rei, Kai, Max.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.210
From here on out,
I'm the challenger!

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:03.440
I didn't forget what
I said back then.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:08.410
I'd be disappointed if you did.
That's the Takao I want to beat!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.300
Let's go, Max!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:23.910
Look at that intensity...
Is Takao really gonna be okay?

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:28.890
A battle between an attack type Bey and a defense type Bey is simple to understand.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:34.850
If Takao can keep attacking, he will win. But, if all of his attacks get blocked...

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.780
Are you saying
Takao might lose?!

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:43.620
Max is the kind of person
who can pull that off.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.880
Their types are different, but they're tied when it comes to pure skill.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:52.210
Whoever outdoes themselves will
have the the slightest advantage.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.110
Takao...

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:57.310
The fated
match now begins!

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.110
Three! Two! One!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.370
Go...

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.650
--Shoot!!

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.480
I won't need any tricks
in our battle, Max!

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.010
Go!
Dragoon Galaxy!

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:29.070
Look at that! Right off the bat, Kinomiya brings out some powerful attacks!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:32.050
Can Draciel hang in there?

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.300
--Max!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.580
That's it, Takao! Go!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.320
Yeah!!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:43.010
Fight on, Draciel!
Don't lose!!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.950
It ain't over!
Go, Dragoon!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:55.730
What a fitting back and forth! It's almost like a power-on-power showdown!

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.330
They can't get off of each
other, even for a second!

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:05.360
Amazing, Takao... This is the match with
you that I've wanted all this time!

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.870
And your attacks are stronger than they've ever been!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:14.300
That's right, I know...

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:21.050
That you've got your highs and lows...
That there's no opponent out there like you!

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:23.190
And in order
to beat you, I'll...

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.920
All right, time to end this!

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.660
Not on my watch!

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.820
Draciel!
GOOOO!!

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:35.670
What?!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.700
Now it's my turn!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:45.610
Oh, this is unusual from such
a defensive player like Max!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:51.820
He meets Kinomiya's head-on
attack with one of his own!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:55.860
This is the first time I've
seen Max be so aggressive!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:58.940
W-What is this?

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:03.540
Whatever, he'll be fine!
Those attacks won't do a darn thing!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:08.740
Go! Go! Draciel!!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:12.940
You want a battle of attack
power against Dragoon?

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:15.000
Bad idea, Max!

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:24.230
Let me show you what the power
of a real attack type looks like!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.920
Go!!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.520
He's going for a
head-on collision!

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:33.250
Max, that's crazy!

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.730
Stop it!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:39.140
No, it's perfect!
Go get 'im!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.030
--What?!
--Yes!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.090
Impossible...!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.640
Dragoon and Draciel's
attack powers are even?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:50.710
He made it...

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.580
But why...?

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:57.730
Keep it together, Max!
It's not like you to drop your style!

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:03.070
What're you talking about? Max knows
exactly what he's doing in his own battle.

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:04.850
Can't you tell?

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:07.730
He isn't trying to win the
battle with those attacks.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:12.320
He's reducing the opponent's power--
Attacking so he can defend.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:17.360
It's true that a defense type Bey doesn't have the power to finish the battle in one hit.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:23.290
But by continuously attacking, he doesn't
have a proper chance to counter.

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:27.670
And by keeping it up,
he seals off his opponent's options.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:32.440
This way, even an attack type Bey won't be
able to take advantage of 100% of its power.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.710
The best defense is a
good offense, like they say.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.200
That kid's not
half bad after all.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:41.110
If this battle draws out for any
longer, it could mean trouble!

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:46.670
Attack type Beys lose power
the longer the match goes on...

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.200
However...

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:53.120
What's he thinking? If he doesn't want the battle to drag on, he knows what to do!

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:58.060
Don't hold back! Takao!
Ram him head-on at full power!

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.300
Daichi...

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.420
All right!

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.230
Here he comes!

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:03.240
Here I come, Max!

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:06.890
Let's see if you can
stop my special move!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.430
Engine Gear!
Full force!

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:14.450
Let's go!
Galaxy Storm!!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.740
This is what I've
been waiting for!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.780
Go, Draciel!!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:30.580
Engine Gear at full power!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.510
T-that's...!

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:43.130
Draciel's Engine Gear has been set to
start when Takao uses his special move!

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:47.820
Oh, no! This is what Max
was really aiming for!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.090
What's that?

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:53.200
If you use the Engine Gear
once, you can't use it again.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:58.770
He baited Takao into using his special move early,
and is going to try to fend it off with his own power.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:02.560
Finish him, Takao!
It's now or never!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.410
Damn! Go!!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.560
If he can keep this up,
Takao will win!

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:29.870
But if he blocks it...!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:36.030
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.990
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:46.860
This is amazing!
They attack and defend!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:50.600
Will this one attack
decide the match?!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.500
Push 'im off, Takao!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.040
Darn it!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.400
Go!!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.480
Hang in there Max!

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:03.230
Max!

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:06.040
Don't blow it!
You better win!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.130
Rick! Michael! Emily! Eddy!

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:13.760
That's right... I've got their souls
riding on my shoulders too!

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:23.360
This is one match...

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.410
This is one match...

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.580
That I can't afford to lose!

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:39.840
Go!! Draciel!!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:01.740
N-No...

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.000
It can't be!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.590
Unbelievable!

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:07.690
Draciel's defense was
able to fend off Dragoon!

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:12.750
Draciel is still in this and Dragoon's special move has been beaten!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.710
My Galaxy Storm...

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:19.860
He did it!!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:23.000
Good going, Max!
Now finish him off!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.150
No, not yet.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:32.050
What's this?!

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.570
A single look at the stadium suggests a return to peace,

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:38.620
as if we've been brought
back to square one!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:42.230
Is this the calm before
another storm? Or...

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.080
I can't underestimate Takao.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.560
If I let up now,
I know I'll be sorry.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:50.720
Calm down, think straight...

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:54.480
Yes... Draciel's real battle
is just getting started!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.050
The tables have turned...!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:01.370
No, now that the
Engine Gear's been used up,

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:05.260
Dragoon doesn't have enough
power to use its special move again.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:09.030
The drawn-out match we were
fearing has already begun.

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.270
Which means...

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:13.620
That ya just gotta
keep attacking, Takao!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.810
You don't have to tell me!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.350
This is all I can
do if I wanna win!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.830
Go, Dragoon!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:30.460
What's the matter, Takao?

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.780
Is that all the
power you've got?

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.820
I-incredible!

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:38.100
He's really laying
on the pressure...

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:42.430
By attacking and making the opponent
attack you, stealing their strength...

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:46.410
This is what's truly fearsome
about defense type Beyblades!

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.000
And that's not all of it.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.820
If you can't get any
of your attacks to land...

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:53.500
You end up losing
your confidence.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.260
Damn...

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.970
Go!!

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:02.630
Once those high waves crash
down on Takao's spirit--

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:05.790
That's when he will
truly face defeat.

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:08.860
Attack me all
you want, Takao.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:12.780
In order to face against
you, I left the BBA,

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:17.060
and came this far despite
clashing with my teammates.

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:20.310
I had to take on the
souls of the guys I beat.

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.260
But all that ends today.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:29.230
I feel nothing but pride for
being able to fight alongside them.

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:33.440
Right. As a member of
the PPB All Starz,

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:38.460
this is one match
I have to win!!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:41.860
Oh no!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.400
Takao!

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.850
You're amazing.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.690
You're amazing, Max!

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.540
I love being able to battle
against such a strong opponent!

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.030
It gets me pumped!

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:58.550
But I can't lose, either!

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.240
Dragoon doesn't have
much power left.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.910
One last shot!

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:05.250
I'm betting it all on this!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:08.690
Sorry, but it's time to
put an end to this!

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:12.550
The next time you attack
will be the end of the match!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.340
Takao!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.140
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:28.260
I've got you now!
Allow me to use a bit of your power!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:31.520
But that's--

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.910
The attack we saw during
the Neo-Borg match.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.550
That's it Max!
Go for it!

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:39.060
Now you can't fully
use your own power!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.120
Here I come, Takao!

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:45.320
Gravity Control!!

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:02.510
Look at this!

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:05.130
Dragoon has been
completely trapped!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.410
Is this the end
of the line?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.120
This is payback.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.210
Y-you wouldn't!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:31.020
Stir up the winds
and howl, Dragoon!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.230
Go! Galaxy Storm!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.180
What?!

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:49.550
W-what?!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.020
H-how...

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.640
Unbelievable!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:58.140
The tides have been
completely turned!

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.950
Where did he summon
all that power from?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.260
Takao Kinomiya takes the win
with another special move!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.810
So the ones going
to the finals will be...

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:10.660
The BBA Revolution!

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.080
He did it!

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.640
He won! Takao won!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.210
Takao...

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.680
No freaking way!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:22.220
Max worked so
hard for it, too...!

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:25.630
I lost...

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.320
I see...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.330
Takao used Draciel's
power for his own...

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.510
To compensate for lacking his
own power to use his special move!

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:39.080
Max!

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.920
Takao...

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:44.320
That was the first time in a while a battle got my blood pumping!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.940
Though I was scared I was
gonna lose there for a sec!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:50.750
So I totally would have
lost if you were fighting the old me.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:52.750
But...

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:56.490
I'm glad to see
you so strong.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:18:02.650
With an awesome Bey like that, it's no wonder
you gave my Dragoon a run for its money.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:04.700
And that's why
you're my rival!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.630
Takao...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.840
Aww, jeez...

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:12.990
I get strong, and you
just get even stronger!

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:15.440
Win it for us, too.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:20.080
You bet! Next time I'll
carry your hopes with me!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.320
Takao!

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:28.300
Ya did it, Takao!

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:31.840
Hey! Get offa me,
monkey boy!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.640
Good work out there, Max!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.040
You were so close!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.900
Sorry, guys.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.850
This was the one match I
wanted to win for everyone.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.810
Which is why I...

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.320
That was a good match.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:49.040
Rick...

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:52.690
Anyone you beat
can agree with that.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.550
'cause I said so.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:19:01.430
Excuse me? Who was the one kicking
the ground when the match ended?

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.350
Aww, come on,
don't say that...

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.710
Rick!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.130
You're so right!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:12.180
Good work out
there, Max, Rick.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.600
Mom!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.730
It's a shame we didn't
make it to the finals, however.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:20.460
But from the looks on your faces, I can see you're both happy in the end.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.590
Right, Michael?

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:25.270
I guess...

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.350
Max, Rick...

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:30.030
I get it now, after
seeing you two in action.

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:32.920
For polar opposites, you two
have become quite the team.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.280
Sometimes you fight,
sometimes you get along.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:40.400
Overcoming that and improving is
what it means to be a real tag team!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.610
Michael...

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.110
Come on, that's embarrassing.

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.440
But you should
remember this, Rick.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:51.730
The next time I battle you,
I'm going to win, no matter what!

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.700
You're on.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:01.350
Michael was the former
ace of the PPB...

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:05.390
In the long run, the two of
them might become rivals too.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:12.370
I wanted to awaken their lost passion a
little by stirring up a fire within the team.

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.300
Now wait
just a second!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:17.480
We can't have you forgetting
that I'm on this team too!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:21.660
Well, first things off,
I challenge you, Max!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.600
Emily...

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.290
Perhaps my plan worked
a little too well.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:30.720
It's off to training for me once
we get back to America...

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.530
Ah, but before that...

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:37.600
And now, the PPB will
improve even more.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.890
Far more than before!

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.290
So the BBA made it
through in the end.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.640
Obviously.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.140
But that power he
used to beat Max...

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.410
We have to be careful.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.430
Be careful?

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.710
If I don't at least do that, then
there's no hope of beating him.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:02.350
I'll be waiting for you
in the finals, Kinomiya.

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.480
And then
I'll defeat you...

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:06.290
At one hundred--

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:10.930
No, I'll defeat you at
two hundred percent!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.430
What's wrong, Takao?

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:17.570
We defeated a lot of powerful teams
and now we're in the top three!

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.540
Be happy, dammit!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:22.570
Yeah, you're right.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:24.980
But Max was really good.

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:28.310
I didn't get off easy,
that's for sure.

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:30.920
H-How could this--!

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.820
The final stages of
the world championships!

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:00.120
This time, the stage is Japan!
It's been so long!

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:02.760
I can't lose to these guys,
no matter what!

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:07.740
How are three teams going to battle? Us, Neo-Borg, and F-Sangre?

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:09.330
We don't know for sure yet!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:12.090
But on the inside,
I already know who I'm gonna face!

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:12.930
You too, Takao?

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:13.960
You too, Daichi?

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:15.140
--All right!!

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:16.270
Let's do it, Daichi!

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:18.820
And we're gonna
win, this time!

00:23:18.820 --> 00:23:21.740
Just you wait!
Time for revenge, F-Sangre!
